  "z₀ = {a} est un pôle d'ordre m = {m}. On pose φ(z) = (z − z₀)^{m} f(z) ; alors Res(f ; z₀) = φ{b}(z₀)/{c}!.": "z₀ = {a} is a pole of order m = {m}. Set φ(z) = (z − z₀)^{m} f(z); then Res(f ; z₀) = φ{b}(z₀)/{c}!.",
  "Calcule Res(f ; {a}) pour f(z) = {b}.": "Compute Res(f ; {a}) for f(z) = {b}.",
  "Ordre m = {m} : on dérive {a} fois (z − z₀)^{m} f et on divise par {b}!.": "Order m = {m}: differentiate (z − z₀)^{m} f {a} times and divide by {b}!.",
  "Le pôle simple z = {b} :": "The simple pole z = {b}:",
