  "f est 2π-périodique et f(x) = {a} sur ]−π ; π]. Quelles affirmations sont vraies ?": "f is 2π-periodic and f(x) = {a} on ]−π ; π]. Which statements are true?",
  "f est paire : bₙ = 0. a₀ = {a} ; hors de n = {m}, aₙ = {goal} ; a{b} = {qq} + ã{b} = {c}.": "f is even: bₙ = 0. a₀ = {a}; apart from n = {m}, aₙ = {goal}; a{b} = {qq} + ã{b} = {c}.",
  "lire les cₖ": "read off the cₖ",
  "coefficients non nuls": "nonzero coefficients",
