  "Lis ses coefficients cₖ et donne ses coefficients réels aₖ, bₖ (convention a₀/2).": "Read off its coefficients cₖ and give its real coefficients aₖ, bₖ (convention a₀/2).",
  "Donne ses coefficients complexes cₖ (sans intégrer).": "Give its complex coefficients cₖ (without integrating).",
