  "Sur ]0 ; π[, F_s f = f (f y est continue). En x₀ = π/2, F_s f(π/2) = {c} = Σ bₙ sin(nπ/2). Écris le terme pour n = 2k + 1 :": "On ]0 ; π[, F_s f = f (f is continuous there). At x₀ = π/2, F_s f(π/2) = {c} = Σ bₙ sin(nπ/2). Write the term for n = 2k + 1:",
  "f(x) = {c} sur ]0 ; π] ; sa série en sinus F_s f a les coefficients bₙ = {a}(1 − (−1)ⁿ)/(πn). Compare F_s f et f en π, puis déduis de la valeur en π/2 la somme S = Σ<sub>k≥0</sub> (−1)ᵏ/(2k + 1).": "f(x) = {c} on ]0 ; π]; its sine series F_s f has the coefficients bₙ = {a}(1 − (−1)ⁿ)/(πn). Compare F_s f and f at π, then deduce from the value at π/2 the sum S = Σ<sub>k≥0</sub> (−1)ᵏ/(2k + 1).",
