  "n pair : sin(nπ/2) = 0, donc bₙ = 0. Pour n = 2k + 1, sin((2k + 1)π/2) = (−1)ᵏ :": "n even: sin(nπ/2) = 0, so bₙ = 0. For n = 2k + 1, sin((2k + 1)π/2) = (−1)ᵏ:",
  "n pair : bₙ = 0. Pour n impair, n = 2k + 1 :": "n even: bₙ = 0. For n odd, n = 2k + 1:",
