  "Sur l’arc, |z + a| ≤ |z| + |a|, donc 1/|z + a| ≤ 1/(|z| + |a|) et |Y(z)| ≤ C/R.": "On the arc, |z + a| ≤ |z| + |a|, so 1/|z + a| ≤ 1/(|z| + |a|) and |Y(z)| ≤ C/R.",
  "Pour majorer |Y|, on minore son dénominateur (|z + a| ≥ R − |a|) : une majoration du dénominateur ne borne pas |Y|.": "To bound |Y| from above, you bound its denominator from below (|z + a| ≥ R − |a|): an upper bound on the denominator does not bound |Y|.",
